<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Titas</book>
  <para style="h">Titas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Titas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titas</para>
  <para style="mt">Titas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hnaṭuantu le Jesuh Khrih ih tirhthlah keimah Paul in ca ka lo kuat. Pathian ih a hrilmi a minung pawl an zumnak fekter dingah le kan biaknak thutak sungih hruai dingah Pathian in ih hril ih ih thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih kan biaknak cu kumkhua nunnak ruahsannak sungah hram a bunmi a si. Thuphan a per dah lomi Pathian in hi nunnak cu leilung seem hlan ihsin in tiamkam zomi a si ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tikcu a kim tikah cumicu a Thuthang sungin a hun langter. Cumi cu ka hnenah i pek ih in Runtu kan Pathian ih thupeknak bangtuk in ka phuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zumnak bangrep kan neihmi sungah ka fa ngaingai a si mi Titas na hnenah hi ca hi ka ngan. Kan Pa Pathian le in Runtu Khrih Jesuh in zaangfahnak le daihnak lo pe hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Krete ah ṭuan ṭulmi pawl ṭuansuak dingah le khawkip ih kawhhran upa ret dingah Krete tikulh-ih ka lo taantanak cu a si. Ka thuzirhmi kha ciing ringring aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kawhhran upa cu mawhthluknak nei lomi siseh; nupi pakhat lawng a nei mi siseh, a faale pawl cu zumtu si hai sehla puarthaunak le thu ngailonak lamih thangsia lomi si hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kawhhran hruaitu cu Pathian hnaṭuan ah ṭuanvo neitu a si ruangah mawhthluknak um lomi a si pei. Mi puarthau le mi thintawi, zurit hmangmi, mi helhlong le paisa duhham mi a si lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mikhual le mileng zohthiamtu a si pei ih thilṭha a ngaina pei. A uk-aw theitu a si pei; miding, mithiang le ziaza ṭhami a si pei ih suup theinak neimi a si pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan zumnak hram thawn a mil-awmi le rintlak a si mi kan Thuthang kha hnget zetin a pomtu a si pei. Cuticun midang pawl kan zirh awkmi thudik thawn thazaang a pe thei ding ih cuih thudik a eltu pawl ih palhnak khal a langter thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uk theih lomi tamzet an um ih cumi pawl cu Judah biaknak ihsin Khristian biaknak ih a ra lutmi sungin an tam cuang. Cupawl cu ṭong tam pawl an si ih thuphan thu in mi tampi an bum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cupawl cu kham an ṭul; ziangahtile zirh lo dingmi an zirh ruangah innsang tampi an buaiter ih cutiih an zirhnak cu ningzakza a si mi paisa duhnak meen ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anmah Krete mi lala profet a si vemi in, “Krete mi cu thuphan per an si, ramsa bangtuk miṭha lo, zaangzel le mihrong an si,” a rak ti ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cuti a timi cu a dikmi a si. Curuangah annih cu napi in kawk awla cuticun zumnak dik an nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Culawng in Judah mi pawl ih neihmi thuanthu meenmeen le thudik a hnongtu pawl ih an rak kenmi milai ih thukham pawl kha zianghman ah an siar nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mithiang pawl hrangah cun ziang hmuahhmuah hi a thiang ṭheh; sikhalsehla miborhhlawh le a zum lotu pawl hrangah cun, an thinlung a borhhlawh ruangah zianghman a thiangmi a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anmah cun Pathian theitu kan si an ti aw; sikhalsehla an ṭuan mi le an tuahmi in a zulhpeh lo. Mitkemza in an um, zianghman thu an ngai lo ih ziangvek thil ṭha tuahtu ding hmanah an tlak lo a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asinain nang cun a dikmi thurin thawn a kaih awmi kha na zirh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Patar deuh pawl kha zu ri hlah uh, thinlung felfai in um uh, nan thinlung uk thei uh; zumnak dik, duhdawtnak le harsat tuartheinak neimi si uh, tiah zirh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cubangtuk ṭhiamṭhiam in nutar deuh pawl kha nunau si ding daan te in nun thianghlim nei dingin zirh aw. Mi relsiat hmang an si lo pei ih zu-ih salah an tla lo pei. A ṭhami an zirh pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nutar deuh pawl in kum no deuh nunau pawl cu an pasal le an faale pawl duhdaw deuh dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mah le mah uk-aw theitu si dingin, mithiang si dingin le an pasal thu ngai in tangdor thiammi nupi ṭha ih an cannak dingah zirh dingin sim aw. Cutiin Pathian hnen ihsin a rami thuthang cu zohman in an relsia lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cubangtuk thothoin tlangval pawl khal mah le mah uk-aw theitu an sinak dingah forh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziang hmuahhmuahah nangmah rori zohṭhim tlak in um aw. Rintlak mifel si awla thu na zirh tikah thungaithlak in zirh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zohman ih soisel thei lo dingin ṭongkam ṭha hmang awla kan ral pawl in soisel ding in thei lo ding ih an ning lehlam a zak sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sal pawl cu nan bawi pawl ih tangah dor uhla ziangtinkim ah an lungawiter uh, tiah sim aw. An thu sawnkir hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule an thil khal ru hlah hai seh. Miṭha an sinak le rinsantlak an sinak kha langter sawn hai sehla, cuticun an tuahmi kipah in Runtu kan Pathian ih thu kan zirhmi parah thangṭhatnak an thlenter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziangahtile Pathian in a zaangfahnak cu mi hmuahhmuah rundam dingah a langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih zaangfahnak in Pathian ziaza thawn a mil-aw thei lomi nun daan le leilung taksa hiarnak pawl baansan dingah in zirh. Cule mah le mah a uk-aw theimi le dingnak le hi leikhawvel ah hin Pathian ih duhzawng thawn a mil-awmi ziaza ih kan nun theinak dingah in zirh fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiin a maksakmi kan Pathian le in Runtu Jesuh Khrih ih sunlawinak a lang ding tiin kan ruahsanmi Ni sunglawi cu kan hngak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah ih nunnak rori kha kannih pawl ṭhatlonak ihsin runsuak dingah le thil ṭha tuah a hiartu si dingah le amah ih bulta mithiang ih in canternak dingah kan hrangah a pek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi thu pawl hi zirh awla na thusim a ngaitu pawl thazaang na pek ah siseh, nun na sim tikah siseh, na thuneihnak kha famkim zetin hmang aw. Zohman in lo hmuhsuam hlah hai seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uktu bawi le thuneitu upa pawl ih tangah dor in an thu nan ngai pei; cule thil ṭha tuah dingah timtuah ciain nan um ringring pei, tiah na milai pawl sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zokhal nan relsia lo pei; daite le rualremte in nan pawl-aw niakno pei ih mi hmuahhmuah parah lungnemnak le umtlanzia thiamnak nan langter ringring pei, tiah sim aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangahtile kanmah hman hi tuih hlanah cun kan rak aa, thu ngai lomi kan rak si ih kan rak palh a si. Taksa hiarnak le tisa nomnak a phunphun ih sal kan rak si. Mi nahsuahnak le mi thiiknak in kan tikcu kan rak hmang. Mi in in hua ih kannih khal in kan hua ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sikhalsehla in Runtu kan Pathian ih zaangfahnak le duhdawtnak a rung lang tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kannih cu in rundamsuak. Kanmah in thilṭha kan tuah ruangah si loin amah ih zaangfahnak ruangah in rundam suak ih hrintharnak le nun tharthawhnak in petu Thlarau Thianghlim ih kholhfainak ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In Runtu Jesuh Khrih sungin Thlarau Thianghlim cu kan parah famkin zetin Pathian in a run toih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cumicu a zaangfahnak ruangih Pathian thawn kan rem awk theinak dingah le kan ruahsanmi kumkhua nunnak cu kan ta a si theinak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi thu cu thudik a si. Hi thu pawl hi thupi an si tiah a hleice ih na ruah dingah ka duhmi a si. Ziangahtile Pathian a zumtu pawl cun thilṭha tuahnak ah an tikcu hmang ding an si. Cumi cu mi hmuahhmuah hrangah a ṭhami le santlaimi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhalsehla aat-thlak thu-el awknak, pupa hmin cazin sau zetzet thu el awknak, tawh awknak le Daan thu-el awknak pawl cu hrial aw. Cumi pawl cu ṭhathnemnak le man neihnak ziang hman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhenṭheknak a suahtertu kha ralrinnak a mal bikah voi hnih pe ta aw; cuih hnuah cun a pawl khal pawl nawn hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cubangtuk minung cu miborhhlawh le misual a si ti na thei ih a sualnak in hnonmi a siter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hnenah Artemas, a si lole Taikhikas ka rak thlah vete in Nikopolis ah zamrangte in i ra tong aw. Ziangahtile cutawkah thlatang sung ka um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apollos le sih-ni Zenas khualtlawn an thawh tikah rak bawm awla an ṭulmi hmuahhmuah rak tawlrel sak aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan milai pawl cu thilṭha tuahnak ah an caan hmang hai seh; cutiin an tuah asile a ṭulnak ih kipah mi an bawm thei ding. Santlaihnak nei loih um meen ding an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hnenih a ummi pawl in cibai an lo buk. Zumnak sungih in duhdawtu pawl kha cibai in rak buk sak aw. Nan zate hnenah Pathian zaangfahnak um hram seh.
  </para>
</usx>
